            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 110,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "even with this here, some other bbappend files overwrite EXTRA_OEMESON for -Dsensor-yaml-gen=${STAGING_DIR_HOST}${datadir}/mtjade-yaml-config/ipmi-sensors.yaml and stuff. I have a patch I'm working on that moves that into PACKAGECONIG."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 110,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I'll take a look as well.  If there are people overwriting EXTRA_OEMESON we can probably clean that up also.\n\nI guess that's why there were so many :append calls..."
                },
                {
                    "file": "meta-phosphor/recipes-phosphor/ipmi/phosphor-ipmi-host_git.bb",
                    "line": 110,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Vernon Mauery",
                        "email": "vernon.mauery@gmail.com",
                        "username": "vmauery"
                    },
                    "message": "I think I worked around this a different way. I moved tests, the whitelist conf, and the oem-library stuff all into PACKAGECONIG. So for now, the only OEMESON stuff is the sensor/fru yaml overrides."
                }
            ],
